        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-6615, 12\" Palermo Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe swirl design of the Palermo 12 Inch Door Pull will add a bit of whimsy to any door. RK International's Palermo Collection is ornate without seeming dated. Available in 6 finishes including brushed english (pictured) and weathered nickel. Just click on the picture on the right to see them all. It comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware for a Thru-Bolt Mounted Pull, a Surface Mounted Pull, or Back-to-Back Mounted Pulls (must order 2 pulls).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/fancy-palermo-cabinet-door-pull-rk-international\"><b>Matching Palermo Cabinet Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/palermo-cabinet-cup-pull-rk-international-cf-915\"><b>Matching Palermo Cabinet Cup Pull</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/swirl-design-palermo-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-115\"><b>Matching Palermo Round Cabinet Knob</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/rectangle-palermo-collection-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-116\"><b>Matching Palermo Rectangular Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Palermo Collection Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 12-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Palermo 12 Inch Door Pull",
                "description": "RK International PH-6615, Palermo 12 Inch Door Pull - The swirl design of the Palermo 12 Inch Door Pull will add a bit of whimsy to any door. RK International's Palermo Collection is ornate without seeming dated. Available in 6 finishes including brushed english (pictured) and weathered nickel. JIt comes packaged with all the necessary installation hardware.",
